~ mateo_running
Mateo_child_crying: Takbo lang... takbo lang... huwag kang lilingon... 
Mateo_child_crying: huwag kang mahuli...
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0] MATEO! BUMALIK KA DITO!!![/shake]
=> END

~ mang_gino_being_a_bitch
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0]IKAW BATA KA! MAY PATAKBO-TAKBO KA PANG NALALAMAN?![/shake]
do _hit_mateo("idle_right")
Mateo_child_crying: [shake level=20 connected=0]Tama na po 'tay!! [/shake] [font_size=60.0][shake level=20 connected=0]tama na po! Ayoko na![/shake]
do _hit_mateo("idle_down")
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0]Ah, dito ka pala lagi nagtatago?[/shake]
do _hit_mateo("idle_right")
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0]Ang dami pang dalang damit![/shake]
do _spawn_gino_mateo_stuff()
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0]Ano, lalayas ka na?[/shake]
do _gino_thrashing_stuff()
Mang gino: [font_size=70.0][shake level=20 connected=0]SIGE LUMAYAS KA! WALA KA NAMANG SILBI![/shake]
Mateo_child_crying: [shake level=20 connected=0]Tama na po, babalik na'ko sa bahay! [/shake] [font_size=55.0][shake]Huwag niyo pong sirain mga gamit ko![/shake]
do _gino_respawn()
Mang gino: [font_size=70.0][shake level=20 connected=0]GAMIT MO? NI SINGKONG DULING WALA KA!![/shake]
do _hit_mateo("idle_right")
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0]Pinagkukuha mo lang lahat yan sa bahay![/shake]
Mang gino: [font_size=55.0][shake level=20 connected=0]At akala mo ba hahanapin ka pa namin ng nanay mo?[/shake]
do _hit_mateo("idle_right")
Mang gino: [font_size=120.0][shake level=20 connected=0]HINDI![/shake]
Mang gino: [font_size=70.0][shake level=20 connected=0]MAG-ISA KA DITO!![/shake]
do _hit_mateo("idle_right")
Mang gino: [font_size=90.0][shake level=20 connected=0]HINDI KA NAMIN KAILANGAN![/shake]
do is_hit = true
=>< mateo_monologue
=> END

~ mateo_monologue
Mateo_child_crying: [color=#808080]([shake]Ayoko na. . . ayoko na. . . bakit ba nangyayari lahat ‘to sa akin?[/shake])[/color]
do _mateo_run_again()
=> END

